E AX3013 120-partial-in-nested-scope.ax:9:11-14 partial-application "partial application of `add`: it takes 2 argument(s) and 1 were supplied" #"`add` takes 2 argument(s); 1 more needed" !"a partial application has to hold the arguments it was not given, and a top-level function has no closure record to hold them in" ?"bind the missing arguments with a lambda: `(lambda (y) (f x y))` builds the value `(f x)` would mean"
